==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* No longer grants {{c|mod|20% less Fire Damage taken}}.
* Now grants {{c|mod|+5% to maximum Fire Resistance}}
* Now grants {{c|mod|+40% to Fire Resistance}} (from 50%).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.16.0|
*Now last '''8''' seconds (previously 5).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.15.0|
* The '''Ruby''', {{il|Sapphire Flask|Sapphire}}, and {{il|Topaz Flask|Topaz Flasks}} now last 5 seconds (previously 4). They now consume 20 of 50 Charges on use (previously 30 of 60).
* Upon completing {{ql|The Key to Freedom}}, you are now offered a choice of the following rewards: '''Ruby Flask''', {{il|Sapphire Flask}}, {{il|Topaz Flask}}, {{il|Amethyst Flask}}, {{il|Diamond Flask}}, {{il|Granite Flask}}, or {{il|Jade Flask}}.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.5.0|
* No longer grant added maximum resistances. Instead, reduce the damage taken of fire damage by 20%.
** (wiki editors notes: The exact mod wording is {{c|mod|20% less Fire Damage taken}})
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Duration increased from 3.5 to 4 seconds. Maximum resistance reduced from 10% to 6%.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.9.13b|
* now display an effect on your character when being used.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.9.13b|rel=before|
* Introduced to the game. (The flask exists since open beta (0.10.0) and probably also existed since closed beta (0.9.X). The exact version that introduced this flask is not known.)
}}
{{Version history table end}}
